# Dependencies and local-only artifacts.
#
# `node_modules` is not shipped by this repository: the package installs from a
# profile-linked directory whose `@deepseek-ai/schemastery` entry is a junction
# into the local DSH profile. Committing it would leak a machine-specific path
# and break every other clone.
node_modules/

